_Campaign shows up to 2 Spotlights. That is a rendering and editorial cap, not one the form enforces._

**Spotlight title:**

Request a session

**Spotlight description:**

Contact 311 to request a free IPM education session for your tenant group, resident council, or community organization. Tell them your group type, size, preferred dates, and meeting location.

You can also reach the Healthy Housing and Vector Control program directly with questions before requesting a session.

**Button link — Link text:**

Request through 311

**Button link — destination:**

External URL → https://www.sf311.org/

### Top facts — \`facts_title + fact_items\` [TYPE] — page not approved

