**Fact 2 — title:**

Service area

**Fact 2 — text:**

Available to schools, camps, museums, and youth groups located within San Francisco

**Fact 3 — title:**

Group size

**Fact 3 — text:**

Fits groups up to about 60 students per session; larger groups can be split into multiple sessions

**Fact 4 — title:**

Lead time

**Fact 4 — text:**

